{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsRuntime\/AVPlayerAdapter\/playImmediately()"},"metadata":{"externalID":"s:18OptiViewAdsRuntime15AVPlayerAdapterC15playImmediatelyyyF","roleHeading":"Instance Method","role":"symbol","title":"playImmediately()","symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"playImmediately","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"()","kind":"text"}],"modules":[{"name":"OptiViewAdsRuntime"}]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/optiviewadsruntime\/avplayeradapter\/playimmediately()"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsRuntime","doc:\/\/optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsRuntime\/AVPlayerAdapter"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"playImmediately","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"()","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"play()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" respects "},{"code":"automaticallyWaitsToMinimizeStalling","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":": the player keeps"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rate at 0 while it re-evaluates whether playback can keep up, which costs"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"~half a second of frozen frame even on an item whose buffer is already"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"full. That re-evaluation buys nothing on a pre-warmed handoff — the item"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"was buffered on the warm-up player precisely so it can start instantly —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so the renderer uses this for warmed items only; cold loads keep "},{"code":"play()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and its stall protection."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Protocol surface since the live resume needs it too: that path corrects content’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"position repeatedly behind the ad, and the hold re-engages on every correction, so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"what costs half a second once costs a second per correction there."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Start playback WITHOUT AVPlayer’s stall-minimization hold."}],"references":{"doc://optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime/documentation/OptiViewAdsRuntime":{"role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The iOS and tvOS runtime of the OptiView Ads SDK: the AVFoundation content-player adapter, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"overlay ad renderer, and the Google IMA integrations."}],"title":"OptiViewAdsRuntime","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsRuntime","url":"\/documentation\/optiviewadsruntime","type":"topic"},"doc://optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime/documentation/OptiViewAdsRuntime/AVPlayerAdapter/playImmediately()":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"playImmediately","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"()","kind":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/optiviewadsruntime\/avplayeradapter\/playimmediately()","identifier":"doc:\/\/optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsRuntime\/AVPlayerAdapter\/playImmediately()","abstract":[{"text":"Start playback WITHOUT AVPlayer’s stall-minimization hold.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","title":"playImmediately()","typ